        "title": "Great energetic Lord Shiva Temple ",
        "text": "Its one of the oldest, energetic, historical LORD SHIVA TEMPLE. It's must visit if you are Hindu, visiting Nepal. Never miss. It's situated in the banks of River Bagmati. Temple is open from early morning until 6.30 pm. In the morning we can view Lord Pashupatinath,offering Whatever we can, 9.30 am until 11AM is ABHISHEK, for this we need to pay at the bank, offer ABHISHEK just few meters from Lord Pashupathinath. Evening Maha Aarari at 5.45 pm. After this they close the temple. But from 6PM until 7.30 pm, there will be Aarati at Backside of temple, in the Banks of River Bagmati, beautiful to watch, it's a Great Fest to our eyes, OM NAMAHA SHIVAIAH ",
